{{! About Page }}
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <title>About - Archers Forum</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/main_page.css">
</head>
<body>
  <div class="content-card" style="max-width: 700px; margin: 2rem auto; padding: 2rem;">
    <h1>About Archers Forum</h1>
    <p>This web application was developed as a forum platform for the Phase 3 deployment project.</p>
    <h2>Features</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Model-View-Controller (MVC) architecture</li>
      <li>CRUD operations for users, posts, and comments</li>
      <li>User authentication with session persistence</li>
      <li>Password hashing for security</li>
      <li>Front-end and back-end form validation</li>
      <li>Sample data for demonstration</li>
    </ul>
    <h2>Technologies & NPM Packages Used</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>express</li>
      <li>express-handlebars</li>
      <li>express-session</li>
      <li>mongoose</li>
      <li>bcryptjs</li>
      <li>multer</li>
      <li>path</li>
      <li>crypto</li>
    </ul>
    <h2>Third-Party Libraries</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Google Fonts (Inter)</li>
    </ul>
    <p>For more information, see the <code>package.json</code> file.</p>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
